" src=\"https://photos-eu.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86d2FsbWFydA/2caab930-3b32-5288-a6e8-3daf8fd174d3\" alt=\"User submitted photo\"/><\/div><\/div><div class=\"BVRRPhotoSectionSeparator BVRRPhotoSectionSeparatorBottom\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"BVRRSeparator BVRRSeparatorReviewPhotosBottom\"><\/div><\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Main\">\n <div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacer BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacerTop\"><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewRatingsContainer\"> <div class=\"BVRROverallRatingContainer\" >\n<div class=\"BVRRRatingContainerStar\"><div class=\"BVRRRatingEntry BVRROdd\"><div id=\"BVRRRatingOverall_Review_Display\" class=\"BVRRRating BVRRRatingNormal BVRRRatingOverall\"><div class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRRatingNormalLabel\"><\/div><div class=\"BVRRRatingNormalImage\">\n<div class=\"BVImgOrSprite\" style=\"width:75px;height:15px;overflow:hidden\"><img src=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/1336/5_0/9/rating.png\" alt=\"5 out of 5\" title=\"5 out of 5\" width=\"135\" height=\"15\" />\n<\/div><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"reviewRating\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Rating\" class=\"BVRRRatingNormalOutOf\"> <span itemprop=\"ratingValue\" class=\"BVRRNumber BVRRRatingNumber\">5<\/span>\n <span class=\"BVRRSeparatorText\">out of<\/span>\n <span itemprop=\"bestRating\" class=\"BVRRNumber BVRRRatingRangeNumber\">5<\/span>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewTitleContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewTitlePrefix\"><\/span><span itemprop=\"name\" class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewTitle\">Great quality<\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewTitleSuffix\">, <\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDateContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDatePrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewDate\">05/30/2025<meta itemprop=\"datePublished\" content=\"2025-05-30\"/><\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDateSuffix\"><\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Content\">\n <div itemprop=\"description\" class=\"BVRRReviewTextContainer\" >\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText387221007_e5uz2ixv07vzdo07syxqfgm0x_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextParagraph BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextFirstParagraph BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText\">Smart and pet-friendly, Coco loves it too!<br />This SUNSEEKER V3 wireless lawn mower robot has been at home for more than a week. To be honest, I was skeptical at first, but I didn't expect the actual experience to exceed my expectations!<br />First Let me<\/span>\n<span class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextSuffix\"><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLinkPrefix\">...<\/span><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLink\"><a onclick=\" if(window.BVAnalyticsTracker){BVAnalyticsTracker.fireActionEvent(this);};&#10;$bv('#BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText387221007_e5uz2ixv07vzdo07syxqfgm0x_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');$bv('#BVRRReview387221007_pclscjk0jneyqb2613co0qs5b_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');bvStopPropagation(event);return false;\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_ToggleReadMore\" href=\"#\" class=\"BVDILink \"><span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">(read full review)<\/span><\/a><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLinkSuffix\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/div>\n<div id=\"BVRRReview387221007_pclscjk0jneyqb2613co0qs5b_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewText BVDIHidden\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewTextParagraph BVRRReviewTextFirstParagraph BVRRReviewTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewText\">Smart and pet-friendly, Coco loves it too!<br />This SUNSEEKER V3 wireless lawn mower robot has been at home for more than a week. To be honest, I was skeptical at first, but I didn't expect the actual experience to exceed my expectations!<br />First Let me share with you how to start the machine with one button: first press the power button for about ten seconds, then press the OK button four times, and the machine will start up. If you want to mow the lawn with one button, just press the Start button once and then press the OK button twice. This is the experience I have summed up. The whole process is very fast!<br />My home is a small lawn, Maybe about 0.2acres. In the past, I had to spend time mowing it manually every week. Now, as long as I open the APP and click it every day, it can work and bypass obstacles. The whole process is quiet and smooth. I usually let it start working in the morning before going to work, and when I get home from work, the lawn has been mowed cleanly, neatly but not &quot;cut to death&quot;, very natural.<br />What satisfies me most is its pet-friendly design. My dog \u200b\u200bCoco is a lively little guy who often runs around on the grass. Every time this robot encounters Coco, it will stop or bypass it in time, and there has never been a collision or fright. Coco is now completely accustomed to its existence, and sometimes he will curiously come over to watch it work, which is really reassuring.<br />In short, if you have a small lawn like me, have pets and don\u2019t want to spend time mowing the grass every week, this robot is really worth having!<\/span>\n<span class=\"BVRRReviewTextSuffix\"><span class=\"BVDI_FullLinkPrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FullLink\"><a onclick=\" if(window.BVAnalyticsTracker){BVAnalyticsTracker.fireActionEvent(this);};&#10;$bv('#BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText387221007_e5uz2ixv07vzdo07syxqfgm0x_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');$bv('#BVRRReview387221007_pclscjk0jneyqb2613co0qs5b_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');bvStopPropagation(event);return false;\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_ToggleReadMore\" href=\"#\" class=\"BVDILink \"><span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">(hide full review)<\/span><\/a><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FullLinkSuffix\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n <div class=\"RRBeforeFeedbackContainerSpacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"BVDI_FV\"><div class=\"BVDI_FVVoting BVDI_FVVotingHelpfulness\"><div class=\"BVDI_FVSum BVDI_FVSumHelpfulness\"><span class=\"BVDI_FVPositive BVDI_FVLevel2\"><span class=\"BVDIPrefix\">+<\/span><span class=\"BVDIValue BVDINumber\">2<\/span><span class=\"BVDISuffix\">points<\/span><\/span><\/div><div class=\"BVDI_FVCounts BVDI_FVCountsHelpfulness\"><\/div><div class=\"BVDI_FVVotes BVDI_FVVotesHelpfulness\"><span class=\"BVDIPrefix\">Was this helpful?<\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FVVote BVDI_FVPositive BVDI_FVLevel2\"><a data-bvjsref=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/submit/1336/15497122464/review/387221007/positive.djs?authsourcetype=__AUTHTYPE__&amp;format=embeddedhtml&amp;innerreturn=https%3A%2F%2Fwalmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com%2F1336%2F15497122464%2Freviews.djs%3Fformat%3Dembeddedhtml%26num%3D100%26sort%3DsubmissionTime&amp;return=__RETURN__&amp;sessionparams=__BVSESSIONPARAMS__&amp;submissionparams=__BVSUBMISSIONPARAMETERS__&amp;submissionurl=__BVSUBMISSIONURL__&amp;user=__USERID__\" data-bvcfg=\"__CONFIGKEY__\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_AddPositiveFeedback_387221007\" href=\"javascript://\" title=\"Yes\" class=\"BVDILink BVDIValue\"><span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\"><span class=\"BVDINumber\">2<\/span><\/span><\/a><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FVVote BVDI_FVNegative BVDI_FVLevel1\"><a data-bvjsref=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/submit/1336/15497122464/review/387221007/negative.djs?authsourcetype=__AUTHTYPE__&amp;format=embeddedhtml&amp;innerreturn=https%3A%2F%2Fwalmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com%2F1336%2F15497122464%2Freviews.djs%3Fformat%3Dembeddedhtml%26num%3D100%26sort%3DsubmissionTime&amp;return=__RETURN__&amp;sessionparams=__BVSESSIONPARAMS__&amp;submissionparams=__BVSUBMISSIONPARAMETERS__&amp;submissionurl=__BVSUBMISSIONURL__&amp;user=__USERID__\" data-bvcfg=\"__CONFIGKEY__\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_AddNegativeFeedback_387221007\" href=\"javascript://\" title=\"No\" class=\"BVDILink BVDIValue\"><span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\"><span class=\"BVDINumber\">0<\/span><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"BVDI_FVReportLink